#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""drover: place coding agents across your machines through herdr-core (hc).

Zero dependencies, Python 3.9+. Runs on the machine you coordinate from; every
other machine is reached with `hc exec --on` / `hc run --on`.

  drover config [--init | --set-json JSON]   show, create or replace the settings
  drover probe                               ask every machine what it can do now
  drover status                              machines + drover agents, for the panel
  drover dashboard [--repo PATH] [--mission ID]   project mission dashboard
  drover dashboard --window [--repo PATH] [--mission ID]   ... in its own window
  drover route ROLE [--repo PATH]            where and with what ROLE would start
  drover run ROLE --repo PATH TASK           start it there (hc run --bg)
  drover cleanup [--repo PATH] [--yes]       remove merged drover/* branches and worktrees

Add --json for machine output (default when piped).
"""

